        "message" : [
          "%md",
          "",
          "## Narrative",
          "",
          "A legitimate account's credentials are stolen or shared. Someone then uses them again and again from a computer that is not part of the account's normal routine. The relationship lasts days to weeks; it is not a one-off login.",
          "",
          "This analysis finds that persistence pattern in the authentication events and checks how many known compromises it catches. It then lists the cases with the same pattern that are not labeled yet, ranked so that an analyst reviews the most suspicious ones first."
        ],
        "selectedVisualization" : "html",
        "visualizationConfig" : null,
